; Husky — model scene for AnimalDefinition.model_scenes.
; Source: Quaternius "Ultimate Animated Animal Pack" (July 2021), CC0 1.0 — same pack as
; Fox; see project/attribution/sources/quaternius_ultimate_animated_animals.tres.
;
; Design role: art.md → Newly Available Animals proposes house, open_grass · Bold,
; farm-tolerant · "village dog," pairs with Cat. Not locked design.
;
; Audit (2026-07-26): 12 animation clips confirmed — Idle, Idle_2, Idle_2_HeadLow,
; Idle_HitReact1/2, Walk, Gallop, Gallop_Jump, Jump_ToIdle, Eating, Attack, Death. (One
; fewer clip than the hooved animals in this pack — canids get a single "Attack" instead
; of separate Attack_Headbutt/Attack_Kick.) Idle/Walk both present and non-degenerate (54
; tracks each). Node structure matches Fox (AnimalArmature -> Skeleton3D -> mesh;
; AnimationPlayer sibling index 1) — note the mesh node itself is literally named "Cube"
; in the raw glTF, a modeler-naming artifact, not a placeholder/missing-mesh issue (the
; mesh data and material are the real husky model).
;
; Scale: 0.2, matching Fox's established factor for this pack (same rationale as
; Deer.tscn). Raw AABB height 3.191 -> scaled height 0.638, a bit taller than Fox (0.535)
; and ShibaInu (0.619) — plausible size ordering for these three canids. FLAG FOR HUMAN
; REVIEW: not yet eyeball-confirmed in engine.
